@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Return request - State Diagram
[*] --> Pending : Submit request
Pending --> Accepted : Accept
Pending --> Rejected : Reject
Accepted --> Rejected : Change decision
Rejected --> Accepted : Change decision
Pending --> Withdrawn : Withdraw
Accepted --> Withdrawn : Withdraw
Rejected --> Withdrawn : Withdraw
Withdrawn --> [*]
note top of Pending
 Only the post author accepts, rejects or changes
 a decision, and only before handover.
end note
note bottom of Withdrawn
 A new submission creates a new request.
 The withdrawn request cannot be reopened.
end note
@enduml
